  "modifications": [
    "Replace the obsolete Gulp/Browserify/Jade/Sass build with an isolated locked build using esbuild, Pug, Sass and SVG font tooling; keep the original build files as historical source.",
    "Retain original renderer, shaders, colors, geometry, sample audio, icon SVGs and drawing/camera interactions; regenerate the original icon font from its 13 SVGs.",
    "Replace remote Google locale request with local English accessible labels; package the original font families Poppins and Roboto locally under their OFL licenses.",
    "Bundle jQuery 2.1.3 locally, preserving its MIT notice; no remote CDN, analytics, or external runtime requests.",
    "Modernize explicit microphone permission to mediaDevices.getUserMedia; release all tracks and pending async work on stop or visibility loss.",
    "Suspend Web Audio until user gesture; remove the silent startup MP3; resume after explicit interaction; sample gain 0.65, original sine-drawing gain 0.2.",
    "Prevent late decoded samples or permission responses from starting after a stop, switch, or hidden page; stop drawing tones when released outside the canvas.",
    "Replace the original externally credited audio-file loader adapter with a small local File.arrayBuffer/decodeAudioData adapter; sound files remain local.",
    "Fix two accidental JavaScript globals and pointer-at-zero/touchcancel handling; preserve the audio analysis and spectral rendering algorithms.",
    "Add keyboard Enter/Space instrument activation, Escape stop, focus indication and aria-pressed state; drawn pitch and camera rotation retain original pointer interaction.",
    "Show an explicit WebGL/Web Audio unavailable panel with full-size/source links; no substitute renderer.",
    "Stop and suspend sound/rendering on blur, hidden, pagehide, or parent atlas-original-stop message. No initial playback; original visual motion starts only on interaction."
  ],
